  (text "Generated from hardware/gen/circuit.py (do not hand-edit; edit circuit.py and regenerate)." (at 25.4 540 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8a8695e5-ef22-4c53-9e79-2f7f8988282d))
  (text "All connections are made by net labels at pin ends." (at 25.4 545 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c17b1be5-c3ff-44ab-b7d6-66e351cf3d69))
  (text "Power: 2S or 3S LiPo on J1. Everything on VSYS is rated for 3S (12.6 V) with margin; SMAJ13A clamps spikes at about 21 V." (at 25.4 550 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid db1dba90-4f49-4d7e-bf75-12b9cbacd655))
  (text "XIAO pins: D0 SDA(GPIO2) D1 VBAT/6(GPIO3) D2-D3 left DRV8870 IN1/IN2 D4-D5 right DRV8870 IN1/IN2 D6 OUT3(GPIO21) D7 OUT2(GPIO20) D8 SCL(GPIO8) D9 LED(GPIO9) D10 OUT1(GPIO10)" (at 25.4 555 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6daf1e1e-9035-4ad1-be97-ff51f160eab9))
  (text "10k pull-downs on every motor input and output keep motors and ESCs off while the ESP32 boots." (at 25.4 560 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5c0cb785-0e3b-4929-9021-efa94f0fcec1))
